{"id":1051001,"chapter_id":1051001,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"极乐边境被摧毁后，许多禁闭者经由FAC和MBCC的通道被押送回了管理局。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"作为狂厄级禁闭者的蜜莉原本应当是最早一批被押送，但因为她过度透支的身体情况被迫留了下来接受长期治疗。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"她的性格实在活泼，醒来没几天，全医院的人就都知道了她对局长那情不知所起、一往而深的爱情。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"【病房场景】","style":18,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"真、真的吗？来救我的人，真的就是那位……狄斯英雄。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"我还以为，那是在快死的时候看到的幻觉……那他岂不是看到了我很悲惨的样子。","female_content":"我还以为，那是在快死的时候看到的幻觉……那她岂不是看到了我很悲惨的样子。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_2","vo_trial_51001_1_2f"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"糟了，原本还想说，第二次见面一定要好好准备，这下全都泡汤了。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"护士","content":"没关系呀，就算错过了第一次，第二次，你们还能见上第三次，第四次。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"护士","content":"来，蜜莉小姐，你的照片，它原本和受审查的东西一起放在大衣的贴身衣兜里，差一点就要被当作证物回收了。我可是跟夜莺副官打了几次报告才要来的。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"啊！谢谢你！太好了，我还以为它掉落在废墟里，找不回来了。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"她把照片深深贴在自己胸口，几乎没有一丝血色的脸上攀上一丝红晕。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"在岛上的时候，它几乎就是我的精神支柱了。我每天都要看着他，和他说话，想着总有一天，他会再次出现……","female_content":"在岛上的时候，它几乎就是我的精神支柱了。我每天都要看着她，和她说话，想着总有一天，她会再次出现……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_8","vo_trial_51001_1_8f"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"现在，一想到局长就在离我那么近的地方，我的心就跳得停不下来，就好像做梦一样。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"护士","content":"蜜莉小姐真的很喜欢局长呢，来吧，把今天的药喝下去。等养好了身体，你就又会是容光焕发的模样，局长也一定会喜欢上你的。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"还要多久呢？我都在床上躺了……照你们说的，我已经躺了快一个星期了！局长要是忘了我可怎么办……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"护士","content":"局长肯定不会忘了你的，但要是急的话，不如我现在就去找夜莺副官申请，让局长来看你？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"——！","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"少女顿时整张脸涨得通红。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"不……不行！我现在还没恢复好！你看！石膏也没拆！身体还动不了，我，我也好几天没化妆打扮了，身体护理也落下了！我、咳咳……咳咳……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"她急得咳嗽了起来。护士赶紧上前帮她顺气。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"总之不行！要等我准备好……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"不过……你可不可以替我把这封信带给局长呢？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"她小心翼翼地从枕头下面掏出了一个粉色的信封。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"我也还记得。","content":"哦~是情书吗？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"不许拆开哦！求求你了~帮帮我嘛！","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"护士","content":"好吧，我帮你~不过估计要过几天才能送到了。局长他们现在恐怕已经启程回狄斯了。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"………………咦？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"护士","content":"好像是有很重要的事情要办吧，不过他给你安排了后续的治疗、住宿以及去往管理局的行程，希望你能……","female_content":"好像是有很重要的事情要办吧，不过她给你安排了后续的治疗、住宿以及去往管理局的行程，希望你能……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_24","vo_trial_51001_1_24f"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"蜜莉没有听完。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"${PlayerName}要走了？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"不，我不要这样！……咳咳……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"我不要一个人留在这里，我要跟${PlayerName}一起走。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"我……等了这么久才再见到他。","female_content":"我……等了这么久才再见到她。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_29","vo_trial_51001_1_29f"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"我不能……不能等在这里了。我要去见他！","female_content":"我不能……不能等在这里了。我要去见她！","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_30","vo_trial_51001_1_30f"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"蜜莉挣扎着从病床上挪动双腿，就要下床。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"连接着她的仪器不断发出警告的声音，但她全然不顾。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"哗啦——","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"护士","content":"蜜莉小姐！！你现在不能乱动！","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"听到病房中传来的警报声，守卫和医生也冲了进来，他们一起制住了蜜莉，试图将她重新移回床上。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"不——放开我！我，我想见局长……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"求求你们了，不要让我被他丢下……让我和他一起走……","female_content":"求求你们了，不要让我被她丢下……让我和她一起走……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_37","vo_trial_51001_1_37f"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"在她挣扎的时候，从她身上渗出了如蜜糖般甜美的味道。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"呼……呼……带我……带我去见局长，求求你们了，带我去吧！","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"护士","content":"……是。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"【沙船内部】","style":18,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"砂洲停机坪上，一艘巨大的砂船正在启航。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"你倚靠在窗边，看到发动机扬起的漫天黄沙中，突兀地出现了一抹蜜色的金。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"局长","content":"？那是什么？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"局长——局长！","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"你居然看到本该卧床的蜜莉在护士医师的护送下，出现在砂船的停机坪上。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"局长——！！","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"你根本听不清她在说什么，只见着她用力摇动着一只手臂，而另一只打着石膏，随即被医师摁了下去。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"局长","content":"夜莺……那不是蜜莉吗？她为什么会在这里？！她不是应该留在病床上静养吗？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"难道是蜜莉的狂厄又再度失控了？还是她被靡音种下的精神控制还未消除？","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"一时间气急攻心，黑环造成的影响依旧在侵蚀你的身体，你感到脑袋传来一阵阵的抽痛，眼前发黑。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"夜莺快步走到窗边望了一眼，手指摁住了耳机。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"机坪警备处，通报情况。有狂厄级禁闭者出现在机坪上，是袭击吗？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……？是吗？安静下来了？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"明白了。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"夜莺挂了电话。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，请放心，没有失控。是……蜜莉她听说你要先行回狄斯，而她要留在这里静养，觉得不能接受，所以追来了。不过刚刚传来了消息，她知道无法追上这艘砂船，情绪逐渐稳定，接受了现实。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"你叹了口气，手指揉着太阳穴。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"局长","content":"接下来我们要做的事情过于严酷，实在不适合带她一起。她之前太苦了，难得摆脱了极乐边境，我希望她能有一段平静的治疗时期。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"局长","content":"我记得，关于她后面被引渡回狄斯的安排，已经签过字了吧。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"是的。但看起来她还没来得及看到就赶过来了。局长实在担心的话，我会再度与她联络，将我们的安排向她明确重申一次。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"选项","options":["麻烦你了","我自己去吧"],"style":6,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001066,"trial_step":66,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"麻烦你了","goto":67},{"text":"我自己去吧","goto":68}]},{"step":67,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"那我这就去安排。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001067,"trial_step":67,"next":[69]},{"step":68,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您的身体需要静养。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"夜莺说着，指了指一旁的仪器。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"你看了一眼，显示屏上纷飞的黑环与人体数据显示着你现在的身体情况，就在刚刚那一小段波动下，它已经触发了鲜红的预警。昭示着你不能离开它的结论。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"局长","content":"咳咳，抱歉，那就麻烦你了。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"【沙船外部】","style":18,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"走……走远了……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"蜜莉无力地瘫坐在了地上。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"呜……呜呜……怎么这样……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"就在这时，守卫们已经围了上来，但看着已经远去的局长，蜜莉一时之间也没有了反抗的力量，任凭他们将自己重新制住。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"只见其中一个FAC士兵来到她的面前，打开了远程通讯。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"MBCC-S-459，蜜莉小姐，你出现在这里违反了我们之前约定的收容规定，严格来说，当前的你算得上是“出逃”。卫兵们有权对你进行攻击。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":11,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"那也没关系！夜莺小姐，我想见局长，我想和他一起回狄斯！","female_content":"那也没关系！夜莺小姐，我想见局长，我想和她一起回狄斯！","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_77","vo_trial_51001_1_77f"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长现在不能见你。之前的BR-005爆发，对他的身体产生了极大的负面影响，他能强撑着解决完极乐边境事件已经十分勉强。如今局长需要的也是长时间的修养与治疗，只是时局所迫，他才必须启程。","female_content":"局长现在不能见你。之前的BR-005爆发，对她的身体产生了极大的负面影响，她能强撑着解决完极乐边境事件已经十分勉强。如今局长需要的也是长时间的修养与治疗，只是时局所迫，她才必须启程。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_78","vo_trial_51001_1_78f"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":11,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"什么……${PlayerName}也病了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"不过，局长也明白你的心意，所以也特意为你做了后续的回程安排，希望你不要辜负这一片心意。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":11,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"夜莺故意将最后半句话说得重了一些，一旁的工作人员掏出了一份有着局长亲笔签名的行程文件。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"蜜莉有些怔愣地接过文件。她脸色微红地用手指在那几个字上摩挲了许久。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"这个……是局长亲自……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"她轻吐一口气，将文件摁在心头。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"那个……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"局长的病……是不是……","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"是不是……我不去打搅，保持静养，就可以让局长好得快一些呢？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"是的。当然这对你也是一样。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":11,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"那我明白了。下一次见面的时候，我一定会调整好状态，不会让局长担心了。","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"蜜莉","content":"不、不过！可不可以请您帮我转交这封信？","voice":["vo_trial_51001_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_milly_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"content":"最后，她小心地递出一份粉色的信封。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"【转场、压暗】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"亲爱的${PlayerName}，","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"我又忍不住提笔给你写信了。","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"我写的字不好，小时候教我写字的人经常打我，所以我好长一段时间不乐意写字。但是不写信，我怎样告诉你我超级超级喜欢你呢？","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"content":"我一直一直想念你。上次见到你的时候，衬衫染了血，有人帮你洗掉了吗？我好想待在你身边，偷偷帮你洗掉衬衫上的血迹。我好嫉妒可以帮你洗衣服的人，有谁这么好命，可以一直待在你身边？","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"如果我有这个机会，我一定紧紧跟着你，一步也不分开。我会给你洗所有的衣服，熨得整整齐齐的，没有人会做得比我更好。","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"我在梦里也在四处找你。但是我不知道去哪里找你，我去得最多的地方是我们最后一次遇到的地方，但是我不可能在那里再遇见你了，尽管在梦里那个地方一点也没有变。","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"求求命运让我能有一次机会见到你吧。我知道你心里也有我，我一定会把握住这次机会，让你知道我有多爱你，我可以做你最完美的爱人。","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"我的爱人，愿这封信带去我无声的千万次亲吻。","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":151001102,"trial_step":102}]}